title: "Japan Family Toilets Dataset"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Family Toilet Japan"
abstract: "Locations of public toilets in Japan with baby changing table, wheelchair access and fee attributes, compiled from OpenStreetMap and municipal open data (Tokyo, Osaka, Nagoya). Updated monthly."
keywords:
  - toilets
  - baby changing table
  - accessibility
  - OpenStreetMap
  - Japan
  - open data
license: ODbL-1.0
url: "https://familytoiletjapan.com"
